\section{Prior art}{

To the author's knowledge, \code{odumesl} is the first R (or Python)
grammar-of-graphics library for ESL. The closest peers are the
now-abandoned Java \code{EmSim} (an ODE integrator, no rendering API),
the TypeScript GUI editor \code{sholtomaud/odum-energy-language}, and
static SVG reference libraries from the University of Florida's
Center for Environmental Policy and the International Society for
the Advancement of Emergy Research. See \code{vignette("odumesl")} for
a full worked example and prior-art scan.
}

